      <Docs>
        <summary>UiAutomation suppresses accessibility services by default.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>UiAutomation suppresses accessibility services by default. This flag specifies that existing accessibility services should continue to run, and that new ones may start. This flag is set when obtaining the UiAutomation from Instrumentation.getUiAutomation(int).</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/UiAutomation#FLAG_DONT_SUPPRESS_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICES" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.UiAutomation.FLAG_DONT_SUPPRESS_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICES</code>.</a></format></para>
